      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To begin the VortexScale setup, first acquire the `vortex-cli` binary from our secure internal repository, ensuring you place it in a manageable location. Following the download, execute `chmod +x vortex-cli` to grant the necessary executable permissions, which allows the operating system to run the file as a program. Next, you must add the directory containing this binary to your system's PATH variable so that the shell can locate the command globally. Once these prerequisites are met, initiate the deployment engine bootstrap process by running the command `vortex init`. Should you encounter permission errors, verify that your user has read/write access to the download location.",
      "source": "target",
